Z||000000||HAGS||01-11-2001||01:52 AM||||A few months ago my tachometer would only work in Park and Nuetral, then for the longest time it didnt work at all, today I started it up and noticed a needle moving, it was the tach working in all gears!  I drove about 2 miles, stopped, drove another mile, stopped, then it wouldnt work when I started it up agian....what could cause this? How does the tachometer get its readings....also the reading jumpped all the way down to the oil pressure needle but there was no way it was really pulling that from the sound of the engine so it was off quite a bit, idle was 2500 but sounded much lower.||||reg||1
